This project is inspired by the architecture described in Spotify Engineering's
post "Portal by Spotify cut my Claude Code token usage by 90%" and the Apache-2.0
licensed shunt plugin in https://github.com/spotify/portal-ai-plugins.

haiku-shunt is an independent clean-room reimplementation that replaces Spotify
Portal / AiKA modes with the Anthropic Claude Haiku API. It does not redistribute
Spotify Portal CLI code.

